     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Jay,<br><div><br></div><div>No problem at all. The proposal is evolving quickly, so no need to look at it. </div><div><br></div><div>Have a great time with the fam.</div><div><br></div>\r\n<div>-Matt</div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div>______________________________<br><br>Matt Whalen<br>PhD Student, Ecology Graduate Group<br><span style=\"color:black\"><span>Department of Evolution &amp; Ecology<br>\r\n</span>\r\n<span></span></span>University of California, Davis<br><span style=\"color:black\">\r\n<span>One Shields Avenue</span><br>\r\n<span>Davis, CA 95616</span></span><br>______________________________<br><br><br></div>\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, Apr 5, 2013 at 7:59 PM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;font-weight:bold;color:#222222;padding:0px\"> \r\n  <a name=\"m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_digest_top\" style=\"color:#222222\" rel=\"nofollow\">Today&#39;s Topic Summary</a></div>\r\n<p>Group: <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051215000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2idQSIBXDEd2KYlb8lUfCo\">http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/topics</a></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n<li type=\"square\" style=\"color:#555555\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">polychoric correlations from lavaan?</a> [3 Updates]</li>\r\n<li type=\"square\" style=\"color:#555555\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lavaan Warning Message</a> [2 Updates]</li>\r\n<li type=\"square\" style=\"color:#555555\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Second Order CFA</a> [3 Updates]</li>\r\n<li type=\"square\" style=\"color:#555555\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nonconvergence Issue with WLS estimator</a> [1 Update]</li>\r\n<li type=\"square\" style=\"color:#555555\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Growth: different ages at each wave</a> [1 Update]</li>\r\n<li type=\"square\" style=\"color:#555555\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Problem: CFA with one general factor and two additional factors (lavaan WARNINGS)</a> [1 Update]</li>\r\n\r\n<li type=\"square\" style=\"color:#555555\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Problem: CFA with one general factor and two additional factors (lavaan WARNINGS)</a> [1 Update]</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/107fc02c02696149\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/107fc02c02696149&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1fwYaUnRzEwFHUsTpjizMB\">polychoric correlations from lavaan?</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">sebasti...@gmail.com</a></span> Apr 05 08:47AM -0700\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Hello, <br>\r\nI estimated a model using categorical data and I would like to get the <br>\r\npolychoric correlation matrix from lavaan. Is that possible?<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThanks!<br>\r\n\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/c01f54ba865808ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/c01f54ba865808ca&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DIK3ZOGBOedl8lj8zBFtz\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">yrosseel &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yros...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Apr 05 11:21PM +0200\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      &gt; Hello,<br>\r\n&gt; I estimated a model using categorical data and I would like to get the<br>\r\n&gt; polychoric correlation matrix from lavaan. Is that possible?<br>\r\n <br>\r\ninspect(fit, &quot;sampstat&quot;)$cov<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\nYves.<br>\r\n\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/a10ce69289d003ae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/a10ce69289d003ae&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Cax40CCVWl1BfFNLqItkU\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">sebasti...@gmail.com</a></span> Apr 05 03:06PM -0700\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Thanks!<br>\r\n <br>\r\nOn Friday, April 5, 2013 4:21:57 PM UTC-5, Yves Rosseel wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/d5dcfc406f45def9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/d5dcfc406f45def9&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29aMcwKEGIE9xye4UVmvgO\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/35a087f3159777cb\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/35a087f3159777cb&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw09w5ckX8rxjhsQC-EJ5SWO\">Lavaan Warning Message</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">Joshua Grubbs &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">joshua.g...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Apr 05 09:13AM -0700\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Hi all,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nI have been using Lavaan for about a year now, after switching from <br>\r\nMPlus... (new computer, didn&#39;t feel like buying a new subscription)  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nAnyway, I have not had any trouble until\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/7e8d4e56079569b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/7e8d4e56079569b4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pzoZaP-j7II3EHojLXjOA\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">yrosseel &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yros...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Apr 05 11:25PM +0200\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      On 04/05/2013 06:13 PM, Joshua Grubbs wrote:<br>\r\n <br>\r\n&gt;  &gt; fit &lt;- sem(model2, data = Moral_Transgressions)<br>\r\n <br>\r\n&gt; --Error in `[.data.frame`(data, , unlist(ov.names)) :<br>\r\n&gt;    undefined columns selected<br>\r\n\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/8f7f76224e84d187\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/8f7f76224e84d187&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32YnWvBW5VB_zPtQzNXg7k\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_2\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/29f2276f9d560366\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/29f2276f9d560366&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hsL46aILpivuVAOWhcpWb\">Second Order CFA</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">yrosseel &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yros...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Apr 05 02:06PM +0200\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      &gt;   f3 =~ TRUST1+TRUST2+TRUST3+TRUST4+TRUST5+TRUST6<br>\r\n&gt;   f4 =~ f1+f2+f3<br>\r\n&gt;    &#39;<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThis is one of the quirks of CFA/SEM. In theory, this second-order model <br>\r\nshould provide exactly the same fit as the\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/d9cf3124cf614551\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/d9cf3124cf614551&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QSx4T5PBWYFG7WHsWtNu2\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dpsc...@gmail.com</a></span> Apr 05 08:05AM -0700\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Thanks for your help. I added <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2h3lcD0GXnOHjE26jK_XcZ\">std.lv</a>=TRUE but now I get a convergence <br>\r\nerror. Just to test, I tried the model with the default estimator and got <br>\r\nthe same convergence error message.\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/eb617fc91ae9ec79\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/eb617fc91ae9ec79&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0CD3EpU-VS0Ziovfc7x6qP\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">yrosseel &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yros...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Apr 05 05:15PM +0200\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      &gt; error. Just to test, I tried the model with the default estimator and<br>\r\n&gt; got the same convergence error message. Is this a sign that the data is<br>\r\n&gt; a really poor fit for a single higher order\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/6f9eaf5303b663df\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/6f9eaf5303b663df&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tCC44iyhfVOTlxr_NLEYs\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_3\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/fe3f2c1abd0d4d8c\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/fe3f2c1abd0d4d8c&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UjO-8H8KhxpYwLf2n47Ql\">Nonconvergence Issue with WLS estimator</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">yrosseel &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yros...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Apr 05 02:13PM +0200\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      On 04/03/2013 05:37 PM, Rob wrote:<br>\r\n&gt; groups (e.g., 4 groups, sample sizes of 20, 20, 20, 20) but only<br>\r\n&gt; converges about half the time with unequal n (e.g., 4 groups, sample<br>\r\n&gt; sizes of 19,20,20,21).\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/b0a8a4b9c8892c68\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/b0a8a4b9c8892c68&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0AP4Akg8Xh79OQjf3uCK24\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_4\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/3614684026c64d1e\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/3614684026c64d1e&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0bBJVV7AUsB0uYv39eboge\">Growth: different ages at each wave</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">yrosseel &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yros...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Apr 05 02:01PM +0200\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      On 03/30/2013 01:45 AM, Rick Cruz wrote:<br>\r\n&gt; points, where children vary by age at each Time (e.g., Time 1 age= age<br>\r\n&gt; 10- age 12).<br>\r\n <br>\r\n&gt; The Tscores option in mplus allows one to model each datapoint\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/662b5df04f14292c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/662b5df04f14292c&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ga6xS3d8_f1vXRpu9FEKE\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_5\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/4e193605fd80b9bb\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/4e193605fd80b9bb&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JHTYr2VDtiSSA5oxUMd-m\">Problem: CFA with one general factor and two additional factors (lavaan WARNINGS)</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">yrosseel &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yros...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Apr 05 12:32PM +0200\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      <br>\r\n&gt;   Why does this happen? I am very grateful for your help.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThe &#39;general&#39; (g) and &#39;specific&#39; (f1,f2) factors should be uncorrelated. <br>\r\nThis explains the warning why lavaan could not compute the\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/101b4e3964ed1716\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/101b4e3964ed1716&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Aal9Klr565--SjIgPwaKW\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_8096682479300859958_13ddd491b986f8f7_group_thread_6\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/1b885abad6b5a185\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/t/1b885abad6b5a185&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0bLgV0GpxomxAuGOVOOx65\">Problem: CFA with one general factor and two additional factors (lavaan WARNINGS)</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dom...@gmx.de</a></span> Apr 05 02:42AM -0700\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Dear community,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nI have a problem with a CFA. I want to fit a model with one general factor <br>\r\nand two additional specific factors. For demonstration purpose I use the <br>\r\n5.2 dataset from the Mplus\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/822995a365e8daa4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/msg/822995a365e8daa4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2vgTOX_TTWdIJVRPIPWQ15\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"color:#555555;padding:27px 0 0 40px\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Group lavaan.<br>\r\n    You can <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">post via email</a>.<br>\r\n    To unsubscribe from this group, <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">send</a> an empty message.<br>\r\n    For more options, <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792433051216000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01AWSQqpP2iG7RW0kNEVPa\">visit</a> this group.<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\r\n  </font></span></p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lavaan+un...@goo